# Canonical full Briareus noneditable uv install; no private scratch/build artifacts.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!.python-version
!services/
!services/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
# Do not send credentials or local build artifacts even if nested under source.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/secrets/**
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache/**
**/.ruff_cache/**
**/.venv/**
**/dist/**
**/build/**
